  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fazer Sertanejo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Centro de Agricultura Alternativa do Norte de Minas (CAANM) will assist smallholder farmers and indigenous communities to improve agroecological production, processing and marketing of fruits and sugarcane in the semi-arid region of Northern Minas Gerais. Project activities also include the development of a participatory certification system and the opening of new markets for agroecological products in the region. The project will benefit about 240 families directly and 1,000 other families indirectly.</narrative>
  </description>
